<<<
worsen. The debatable words are: black & blacken: the second is the wider word used for most purposes, black being confined to the sense put black colour upon,
===
worsen.*

The debatable words are:

*black* & *blacken*: the second is the wider word used for most purposes, *black* being confined to the sense put black colour upon,
